WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:05.831
- Good morning. Carpe Diem.

00:00:08.076 --> 00:00:10.176
Fightin' them cavities. Haha.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:28.653
This is my jam.

00:00:31.217 --> 00:00:35.068
Yeah, Wednesday! Humpday, ya'll. Hey.

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:42.618
Beautiful.

00:00:47.655 --> 00:00:49.791
Getting' ready to see my girl.

00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:52.447
She takin' forever, though.

00:00:52.447 --> 00:00:55.947
- It smells weird. Did
you have pizza in here?

00:00:55.947 --> 00:00:57.257
What are you looking at?
- What?

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:58.058
- What are you looking at?

00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:03.096
- Don't put everything on Snapchat! Jesus!

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.431
You need to get a life!

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:05.599
Are you filming me right now?

00:01:05.599 --> 00:01:06.874
Are you filming me?
- No, I'm not!

00:01:10.777 --> 00:01:12.189
- Drink with me, Don.

00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:13.982
- [Justin] I can't, I'm driving.

00:01:13.982 --> 00:01:15.241
- You're driving?

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.571
- [Justin] Hey, Zack, get
out from behind the bar.

00:01:19.571 --> 00:01:22.407
- Oh, I'm a bartender. What do ya want?

00:01:24.145 --> 00:01:25.719
- [Voiceover] Hey, kid, stop it!

00:01:25.719 --> 00:01:27.478
Get the fuck out of my bar right now!

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:29.476
- [Justin] Yo, we gotta go!

00:01:30.952 --> 00:01:33.259
Oh, Zack, no!

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:35.899
- Dude, I don't feel good,
bro. Just go without me.

00:01:35.899 --> 00:01:37.255
- [Justin] What do you mean?

00:01:37.255 --> 00:01:39.299
- Just go, dude, I need
to find a bathroom.

00:01:43.483 --> 00:01:46.899
- Oh no. I just hit this car.

00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:49.176
- Hey buddy! What's your problem man,

00:01:49.176 --> 00:01:50.436
you just hit my car!

00:01:50.436 --> 00:01:52.104
What are you Snapchatting and driving?

00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:53.906
Give me that! Give me that!

00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:58.469
- Whoa, this dude just
put me in his trunk. What?

00:01:58.469 --> 00:02:01.154
I think I just got kidnapped.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.907
I'm in his basement, I think.

00:02:03.907 --> 00:02:06.910
- Justin! I'm here to break you out!

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.060
Is this Snapchat?
- Yeah.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:08.935
- Hey, what's up everybo--

00:02:08.935 --> 00:02:11.998
- [Voiceover] Hey, get back here!

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:14.292
- [Justin] Zack! Zack, no!

00:02:14.292 --> 00:02:17.602
- I've been shot! I just got shot!

00:02:17.602 --> 00:02:20.656
- [Justin] Go. Just
go, just go peacefully.

00:02:24.594 --> 00:02:26.591
- It's 3 o'clock in the morning, Justin.

00:02:26.591 --> 00:02:28.431
It's 3 o'clock in the
morning, I just can't.

00:02:28.431 --> 00:02:29.684
And you're doing this again, please.

00:02:29.684 --> 00:02:31.142
- [Justin] Something happened with Zack.

00:02:31.142 --> 00:02:32.534
- Something happened.
You gotta be kidding me.

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:33.537
I'm leaving you.

00:02:44.521 --> 00:02:47.200
- Yo, these tacos are bomb!

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:50.828
So good.

